          {
            "key": "description",
            "values": [
              "Obsessed with trade and exports the population of X-283N1 has no time for politics and regulations. They're unified under CEO Arnan de Gans who runs the planet. Whatever goes for a government on the bustling planet is modeled like a corporate aboard of directors which answers only to CEO Arnan de Gans."
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "description",
            "values": [
              "The self-appointed CEO expects his planet to be profitable and prosperous. Some say X-283N1 is the most prosperous trading powerhouse in the known galaxy."
